2026-09-27T09:31:32.0187161Z     Features
2026-09-27T09:31:32.0187326Z     --------
2026-09-27T09:31:32.0187400Z     
2026-09-27T09:31:32.0187871Z     - Detailed info on failing `assert statements <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/how-to/assert.html>`_ (no need to remember ``self.assert*`` names)
2026-09-27T09:31:32.0187950Z     
2026-09-27T09:31:32.0188038Z     - `Auto-discovery
2026-09-27T09:31:32.0188326Z       <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/explanation/goodpractices.html#python-test-discovery>`_
2026-09-27T09:31:32.0188431Z       of test modules and functions
2026-09-27T09:31:32.0188510Z     
2026-09-27T09:31:32.0188882Z     - `Modular fixtures <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/explanation/fixtures.html>`_ for
2026-09-27T09:31:32.0189053Z       managing small or parametrized long-lived test resources
2026-09-27T09:31:32.0189133Z     
2026-09-27T09:31:32.0189384Z     - Can run `unittest <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/how-to/unittest.html>`_ (or trial)
2026-09-27T09:31:32.0189485Z       test suites out of the box
2026-09-27T09:31:32.0189565Z     
2026-09-27T09:31:32.0189661Z     - Python 3.10+ or PyPy3
2026-09-27T09:31:32.0189741Z     
2026-09-27T09:31:32.0190215Z     - Rich plugin architecture, with over 1300+ `external plugins <https://docs.pytest.org/en/latest/reference/plugin_list.html>`_ and thriving community
